    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925010/extras/9e06e177b06f4254b50b733239ea7b5d.poster.avif?t=1722169431\" width=696 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925010/extras/9e06e177b06f4254b50b733239ea7b5d.webm?t=1722169431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925010/extras/9e06e177b06f4254b50b733239ea7b5d.mp4?t=1722169431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In &quot;Cryptic Route,&quot; you start as the protagonist driving through a dark night, surrounded by the ambiance of rain.<br><br>With no clear understanding of why, you find yourself in this situation.<br><br>Throughout the journey, only a shovel and a cellphone are left on the passenger seat, offering no clues about the unfolding events or the mission at hand.<br><br>As you progress along the road, the eerie combination of the dark night, the sound of rain, and the protagonist's own breathing immerse you into unsettling situations.<br><br>These atmospheric elements set the stage for significant choices that determine the outcome of your journey.<br><br>The game's multiple ending system ensures that every decision you make leads to consequences, branching out into various outcomes.<br><br>This game plunges you into the atmosphere of a dark night accompanied by the sound of rain, challenging you to decipher the secrets hidden within the forest alongside the protagonist amidst a palpable sense of suspense.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925010/extras/9e06e177b06f4254b50b733239ea7b5d.poster.avif?t=1722169431\" width=696 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925010/extras/9e06e177b06f4254b50b733239ea7b5d.webm?t=1722169431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925010/extras/9e06e177b06f4254b50b733239ea7b5d.mp4?t=1722169431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In &quot;Cryptic Route,&quot; you start as the protagonist driving through a dark night, surrounded by the ambiance of rain.<br><br>With no clear understanding of why, you find yourself in this situation.<br><br>Throughout the journey, only a shovel and a cellphone are left on the passenger seat, offering no clues about the unfolding events or the mission at hand.<br><br>As you progress along the road, the eerie combination of the dark night, the sound of rain, and the protagonist's own breathing immerse you into unsettling situations.<br><br>These atmospheric elements set the stage for significant choices that determine the outcome of your journey.<br><br>The game's multiple ending system ensures that every decision you make leads to consequences, branching out into various outcomes.<br><br>This game plunges you into the atmosphere of a dark night accompanied by the sound of rain, challenging you to decipher the secrets hidden within the forest alongside the protagonist amidst a palpable sense of suspense.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Cryptic Route&quot; begins with the protagonist driving through a rainy night forest. Relying on navigation, each choice influences the outcome of the journey. The multiple ending system offers various results, immersing players into a tale of mystery and horror.",
